                  "kind": "text",
                  "name": "Tip Body",
                  "text": "Step onto the MAGENTA pad (right) to deploy into the\nBREACH & CLEAR mission — clear every hostile, then extract.\nGreen MEDKITS restore your integrity.",
                  "style": {
                    "color": "rgba(226,238,255,0.92)",
                    "fontSize": "15px",
                    "fontWeight": "600",
                    "textAlign": "center",
                    "custom": {
